WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.075
The MAID connection.

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:06.450
Brookfield is one of the largest owners of seniors housing globally.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.187
MAID reduces demand for long-term seniors care.

00:00:10.187 --> 00:00:17.525
The Parliamentary Budget Officer estimated MAID saves the healthcare system 149 million dollars per year.

00:00:17.525 --> 00:00:23.837
By 2047, cumulative savings reach 1.273 trillion dollars.

00:00:23.837 --> 00:00:28.025
Carney holds 6.8 million in Brookfield options.

00:00:28.025 --> 00:00:31.962
The fiscal incentive aligns with the asset portfolio.
